I2                                       INTEGER                     
I3                                       INTEGER                     
[ INDEX ]                                                       
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
NAME                                     TYPE     IS UNIQUE     COLUMN
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
IDX1                                     BTREE                  I1 ASC
IDX2                                     BTREE                  I2 ASC
T1 has no primary key
